  "description": "Load PDF files into DoclingDocument structured models with PdfPig. Supports font-size heading detection, bullet/numbered lists, spatial paragraph grouping, encrypted PDFs, metadata extraction and page headers. File sources use normalized absolute paths for consistent RAG document identity across relative/absolute registrations and separate identities for same-named files in different folders. What's New in v1.1.2: Stable absolute-path document identity across relative and absolute registrations.",
